d the $0 (cached input is charged at ~10% or free).\n   - \"OpenAI Standard 文本 API，单次完整输入 ≤ 272000 Token，蜂桥计费输入 < 272000 Token\" → two things: the upstream (OpenAI standard text API) allows a single full input up to 272k tokens; and the relay bills input tokens only up to <272k, i.e. beyond that's not counted/or it's the cap. So yes, 272k is a per-request input ceiling — it is a context-length limit per request, but a generous one (roughly 272k, ~200k+ Chinese chars).\n   - \"$100 → $0\" is marketing arithmetic, and \"官价核验于 2026-11-19\" is their price-verification date.\n3. Is it free? Yes, in the sense that the free group bills $0 for that model until Nov 30. But it's a relay, not OpenAI — the usual caveats:\n   - \"免费分组\" typically means a shared/limited pool: rate limits (RPM/TPM/concurrency), possibly queueing, possibly no SLA, may break; may be withdrawn without notice.\n   - Data goes through the relay — don't send secrets/regulated data.\n   - \"免费\" usually funds a paid group; the free group may route to a cheaper/quantized upstream or be an intro offer.\n   - The 96% cache hit is the actual reason it's cheap: cached input is nearly free, so their cost is dominated by output tokens.\n4. What limits to actually check on their site: 免费分组的 RPM/并发/每日额度, 是否支持 tools/vision/stream, 输出 token 上限(max_tokens), 是否限制 max context 272k inclusive, 模型是否真是官方 gpt-5.5 还是映射.\n\nAlso: is this the same 蜂桥 they use? Yes, models.fyrali.com. I can mention that their local config has the bifrost channel but gpt-5.5 isn't in the configured model list — so if they want to use it, they'd need to add it.\n\nHmm — careful: is \"蜂桥\" = fyrali? The config doesn't say 蜂桥 explicitly. Let me check if there's any Chinese name. Probably. The domain models.fyrali.com is \"bifrost\"-branded (Bifrost = 虹桥/蜂桥 pun). I'll hedge slightly: \"看域名/品牌，蜂桥就是 Bifrost —— 你本机配的 bifrost 渠道（models.fyrali.com）\". Moderate confidence. I could verify by checking if there's any doc mention. Let me quickly check ~/.dsh for 蜂桥.\n\nActually let me just do one quick grep across ~/.dsh for 蜂桥. Fast."}},{"type":"block-end","index":1,"block":{"type":"tool-call","id":"call_470f96a213044f04a5eca2c8","name":"bash","arguments":"{\"command\":\"grep -rl \\\"蜂桥\\\" ~/.dsh --include=\\\"*.yml\\\" --include=\\\"*.yaml\\\" --include=\\\"*.json\\\" --include=\\\"*.md\\\" 2>/dev/null | head; echo ---; grep -rn \\\"蜂桥\\\" ~/.dsh/profiles/web/cordis.patch.yml 2>/dev/null | head\",\"description\":\"Look for 蜂桥 branding in local config\"}"}},{"type":"usage","usage":{"inputTokens":323,"outputTokens":1040,"totalTokens":43987,"cacheReadTokens":42624}},{"type":"finish","reason":{"kind":"tool-calls"},"replayState":{"response":{"kind":"pi-ai","version":2,"api":"openai-completions","provider":"agent2api","model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","responseId":"resp_6103c1c9-6acb-9990-8d3a-5109686f466d","stopReason":"toolUse"},"blocks":[{"type":"text"},{"type":"tool-call"}]}}]